---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Platform Fee Matrix"
  description="Terms of Service and disclaimer for Platform Fee Matrix."
>
  <Nav />

  <section style="position: relative; padding: 70px 24px 80px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 38px); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-ink); margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.8px;">
      Terms of Service
    </h1>

    <div class="card-base" style="padding: 36px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-body); font-size: 15px;">
      <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-mute); margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Last updated: September 1, 2026
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-ink); margin: 24px 0 10px;">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">
        By accessing and using Platform Fee Matrix, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-ink); margin: 24px 0 10px;">2. Informational Disclaimer</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">
        Calculations, fee comparisons, tax explanations, and estimates provided by Platform Fee Matrix are for educational and simulation purposes only. Platform pricing structures change periodically. Always verify official platform pricing pages before making business decisions.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-ink); margin: 24px 0 10px;">3. Trademarks & Ownership</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">
        All company names, logos, and platform trademarks (including Stripe, Lemon Squeezy, Paddle, Gumroad, Whop, Payhip, Sellfy, Podia, Stan Store, Teachable, Fiverr, Etsy, Amazon, and Upwork) are properties of their respective owners. Their mention does not imply endorsement or affiliation.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-ink); margin: 24px 0 10px;">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0;">
        Under no circumstances shall Platform Fee Matrix be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from reliance on the calculation models.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
